  - prospective replication
  - reproducible research
abstract: >-
  Software, registered methods and public aggregate evidence on whether options
  order flow improves intraday realized-variance forecasts beyond price history
  and the implied volatility surface. Earlier studies found null or negative
  validation results. RP4 v4 reports a small conditional linear-flow improvement
  at 15 minutes over 419 historical sessions, with 5 minutes secondary, no
  full-sequence confirmation in the final window, and prospective replication
  pending. Forecast-loss reduction is not evidence of trading profitability.
